[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9361.87, "timestamp": "02:36:01", "text": "请修改。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9374.55, "timestamp": "02:36:14", "text": "看来观众们觉得挺有意思的，是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9376.429, "timestamp": "02:36:16", "text": "嗯？什么？嗯？什么？哦，哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9379.309, "timestamp": "02:36:19", "text": "那是否意味着观众觉得它很有趣？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9384.309, "timestamp": "02:36:24", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9386.71, "timestamp": "02:36:26", "text": "我不小心瞥了一眼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9388.15, "timestamp": "02:36:28", "text": "我做了这些。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9390.67, "timestamp": "02:36:30", "text": "是的，是的，是的。我对此也没什么意见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9396.59, "timestamp": "02:36:36", "text": "当然有。这样的方言。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9406.83, "timestamp": "02:36:46", "text": "好的，我把它们送到这附近了。 [笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9412.23, "timestamp": "02:36:52", "text": "它已经破旧了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9418.998, "timestamp": "02:36:58", "text": "我不太擅长那种类型的谈话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9419.63, "timestamp": "02:36:59", "text": "[笑声]"}]